  "Edison admite que las direcciones de Kosmos cambian con la redacción del objetivo. Antes de gastar, mira que primeras tareas propondría ROSA2018 con tres redacciones.": "Edison admits that Kosmos's directions change with the wording of the objective. Before spending, look at which first tasks ROSA2018 would propose with three wordings.",
  "Editar": "Edit",
