  "Huecos de la misión sin cubrir ({huecos})": "Uncovered mission gaps ({huecos})",
  "Hypothesis Killer y registro de decisiones": "Hypothesis Killer and decision log",
  "Hypothesis Killer: el revisor que somete cada hipótesis a comprobaciones fijas (citas reales, fidelidad a la fuente, supuestos, falsabilidad, novedad...) y decide por regla si avanza, se reformula, se suspende o se descarta.": "Hypothesis Killer: the reviewer that puts each hypothesis through fixed checks (real citations, fidelity to the source, assumptions, falsifiability, novelty...) and decides by rule whether it advances, is reformulated, is suspended or is discarded.",
