  "Te escucho. Puedes pararte a pensar: se envía tras unos segundos de silencio.": "I'm listening. You can pause to think: it sends after a few seconds of silence.",
  "Te escucho. Tu voz la transcribe el navegador: Chrome en servidores de Google, Safari en los de Apple o en el propio Mac. La respuesta se lee con las voces del Mac y no sale de la máquina.": "I am listening. Your voice is transcribed by the browser: Chrome on Google's servers, Safari on Apple's servers or on the Mac itself. The answer is read with the Mac's voices and never leaves the machine.",
  "Te espera una cosa:": "One thing is waiting for you:",
  "Te esperan {tareas} cosas:": "{tareas} things are waiting for you:",
  "Te está escuchando. Pulsa para enviar, o cállate y se envía sola.": "It is listening to you. Press to send, or stop talking and it sends on its own.",
  "Te está leyendo la respuesta. Pulsa para que se calle.": "It is reading the answer to you. Press to stop it.",
  "Techo por regla: el nivel máximo que permite lo que hay contado (cohortes distintas, evidencia directa no sintética, peso de los apoyos). El juez explica dentro de esa caja, no la fija.": "Rule-based ceiling: the highest level allowed by what has been counted (distinct cohorts, direct non-synthetic evidence, weight of the supports). The judge explains within that box, it does not set it.",
